+    pair (2j, 2j + 1) in the same slot, so the pair is the placement unit (cost = the larger of its two tiles' group costs; the last pair of
+    an odd tile count is one lone tile on the even CTA).  Pairs are placed in descending cost (ties: lower pair index) onto the least-loaded
+    CTA pair (ties: lower pair index); each CTA pair's pairs are then sorted ascending so every CTA visits its tiles in ascending tile order
